  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "用计算器按键在限定关卡中算出目标数字",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Your goal is to pass the required number of levels in one run, where you need to use the buttons on the calculator to get a certain number. Don't think it will be that easy, you'll be met with tricks and difficulties that will make you rack your brain over the strategy.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3043740/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "不同计算器拥有独立特性与按键组，还能扩容装更多按钮",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Choose one of several calculators to play the game. Each calculator has its own feature and set of buttons. Spend money in the store to increase the size of your calculator so it can accommodate even more buttons.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3043740/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "按键有次数限制，需组合运算并用最少步数赚钱",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Each button has a special action. Some buttons can literally turn the course of the game around. Buttons can perform various operations on numbers and other buttons. Earn money by getting the required number in as few moves as possible in each round. Each button has a limited number of uses. Cleverly combine buttons to progress further.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3043740/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
